{"id":56078,"date":"2026-08-01T06:20:52","date_gmt":"2026-08-01T05:20:52","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=56078"},"modified":"2026-09-06T12:59:48","modified_gmt":"2026-09-06T11:59:48","slug":"a-corrida-mais-pintas-ao-por-do-sol-quiaoss","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/a-corrida-mais-pintas-ao-por-do-sol-quiaoss\/","title":{"rendered":"A corrida mais pintas (ao p\u00f4r do sol) 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">A corrida mais pintas (ao p\u00f4r do sol) 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2026 de <strong>A corrida mais pintas (ao p\u00f4r do sol)<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>5 de setembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), na deslumbrante <strong>Praia de Quiaios<\/strong> e Murtinheira, no concelho da <strong>Figueira da Foz<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Coimbra<\/strong>. Organizada pelo <strong>Figueira Kayak Clube<\/strong> com o apoio da <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Quiaios<\/strong> e do <strong>Munic\u00edpio da Figueira da Foz<\/strong>, esta iniciativa l\u00fadica e festiva enche a costa de cor e alegria ao cair da tarde.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida agendada para as <strong>18:30<\/strong> ao p\u00f4r do sol, o evento prop\u00f5e uma animada <strong>corrinhada de 5 km<\/strong> acess\u00edvel a todas as idades, onde correr ou caminhar \u00e9 sin\u00f3nimo de festa, m\u00fasica, explos\u00f5es de cor e divers\u00e3o garantida para toda a fam\u00edlia.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 18:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Praia de Quiaios, Figueira da Foz, Coimbra<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5 km (Corrida e Caminhada com Cores ao P\u00f4r do Sol)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Figueira Kayak Clube \/ Junta de Freguesia de Quiaios<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">L\u00fadica<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida e Caminhada 5 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 5 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">8.00 \u20ac<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza A corrida mais pintas 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no dia 5 de setembro de 2026 (S\u00e1bado), com partida \u00e0s 18:30 na Praia de Quiaios, na Figueira da Foz.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A prova tem cariz competitivo com tempos e classifica\u00e7\u00f5es?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">N\u00e3o, trata-se de um evento exclusivamente l\u00fadico e inclusivo em formato de corrida e caminhada com p\u00f3 colorido, sem fins competitivos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia a percorrer?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso tem aproximadamente 5 km ao longo da costa da Praia de Quiaios e passadi\u00e7os da Murtinheira.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de participante?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O kit inclui t-shirt oficial do evento, \u00f3culos de sol, saqueta de p\u00f3 colorido, seguro e acesso \u00e0 festa final.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como posso efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma Lap2Go at\u00e9 ao fecho das vagas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"A corrida mais pintas (ao p\u00f4r do sol) 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-05\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Praia de Quiaios\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Figueira da Foz\", \"addressRegion\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Figueira Kayak Clube \/ Junta de Freguesia de Quiaios\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza A corrida mais pintas 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no dia 5 de setembro de 2026 (S\u00e1bado), com partida \u00e0s 18:30 na Praia de Quiaios, na Figueira da Foz.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A prova tem cariz competitivo com tempos e classifica\u00e7\u00f5es?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"N\u00e3o, trata-se de um evento exclusivamente l\u00fadico e inclusivo em formato de corrida e caminhada com p\u00f3 colorido, sem fins competitivos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia a percorrer?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O percurso tem aproximadamente 5 km ao longo da costa da Praia de Quiaios e passadi\u00e7os da Murtinheira.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui o kit de participante?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O kit inclui t-shirt oficial do evento, \u00f3culos de sol, saqueta de p\u00f3 colorido, seguro e acesso \u00e0 festa final.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como posso efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma Lap2Go at\u00e9 ao fecho das vagas.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66133,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,478],"event_type_2":[37,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-56078","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-praia-de-quiaos-figueira-da-foz","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type_2-coimbra","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/a-corrida-mais-pintas-ao-por-do-sol-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/56078","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning